                    </span>
                    <span class="text-[9px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">New</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-snug">
                    Ishihara 22-plate diagnostic
