                    <span class="text-[9px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-teal-100 dark:bg-teal-950 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">New</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-snug">
                    Digital Snellen optotype chart
